    "pageTitle": "复杂分母换元后整理目标求最小值",
    "pageDescription": "复杂分母换元后整理目标求最小值的逐步解析。",
    "breadcrumbTitle": "基本不等式 · 换元法 3",
    "breadcrumbLabel": "解不等式与基本不等式",
    "breadcrumbPath": "site/senior-high/index.html",
    "breadcrumbSearch": "?chapter=inequalities&section=inequality-relations&module=basic-inequalities&method=substitution-method"
  },
  "problem": {
    "source": "",
    "keyPoints": {
      "title": "解题要点",
      "lead": "",
      "items": [
        "观察原式结构：识别目标中的两个完整分母 \\(a+1\\)、\\(b+1\\)，并把条件整理为它们的定和",
        "整体换元：令 \\(u=a+1>1，v=b+1>1\\)，同步改写条件，并把新目标整理为 \\(-1+\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)",
        "观察换元后的结构：常数 \\(-1\\) 不影响取最小值，只需研究负一次倒数和；它与正一次条件可配成 0 次齐次式",
        "配齐次式：\\(3(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})=2+\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
        "应用基本不等式：\\(\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\ge2\\)，所以原目标不小于 \\(\\frac{1}{3}\\)",
        "验证取等并还原：\\(u=v=\\frac{3}{2}\\)，对应 \\(a=b=\\frac{1}{2}\\)"
      ]
    },
    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "已知 \\(a>0，b>0，a+b=1\\)，求 \\(\\frac{a^2}{a+1}+\\frac{b^2}{b+1}\\) 的最小值。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "观察原式结构",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "condition": {
          "label": "条件整式",
          "expression": "\\(a>0，b>0，a+b=1\\)",
          "tag": "可整理成分母定和"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "目标整式",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{a^2}{a+1}+\\frac{b^2}{b+1}\\)",
          "tag": "两个完整分母"
        },
        "organization": {
          "substitutionHint": {
            "mappings": [
              {
                "numerator": "\\(a^2\\)",
                "denominator": "\\(a+1\\)",
                "variable": "\\(u\\)",
                "assignment": "\\(a+1>1\\)"
              },
              {
                "numerator": "\\(b^2\\)",
                "denominator": "\\(b+1\\)",
                "variable": "\\(v\\)",
                "assignment": "\\(b+1>1\\)"
              }
            ],
            "ariaLabel": "识别目标中的两个完整分母 a 加 1 与 b 加 1，分别令 u 与 v 整体换元"
          }
        },
        "reading": "完整分母",
        "route": "整体换元"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "由 \\(a>0，b>0\\)，得 \\(a+1>1，b+1>1\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "目标的两个分母分别是完整整式 \\(a+1\\)、\\(b+1\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "把条件整理为 \\((a+1)+(b+1)=3\\)，可对两个完整分母分别整体换元"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "路线判断",
          "完整分母整体换元"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "整体换元",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "showFocus": false,
        "condition": {
          "label": "原条件",
          "expression": "\\(a+b=1\\)"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "原目标",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{a^2}{a+1}+\\frac{b^2}{b+1}\\)"
        },
        "organization": {
          "label": "整体换元：同步改写并整理新目标",
          "steps": [
            {
              "label": "定义与逆关系",
              "expression": "\\(u=a+1，v=b+1；a=u-1，b=v-1\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "改写条件",
              "expression": "\\(u+v=3\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "整理两项",
              "expression": "\\(\\frac{(u-1)^2}{u}=u-2+\\frac{1}{u}，\\frac{(v-1)^2}{v}=v-2+\\frac{1}{v}\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "改写目标",
              "expression": "\\(-1+\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "reading": "完成换元与整理",
        "route": "重新观察结构"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "令 \\(u=a+1>1，v=b+1>1\\)，则 \\(a=u-1，b=v-1\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "条件 \\(a+b=1\\) 改写为 \\(u+v=3\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "换元后的分子仍含平方，用整式除法整理 \\(\\frac{(u-1)^2}{u}=u-2+\\frac{1}{u}\\)，另一项同理"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "目标改写为 \\(u+v-4+\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}=-1+\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "换元结果",
          "u+v=3｜目标为 −1+1/u+1/v"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "观察换元后的结构",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "condition": {
          "label": "条件整式",
          "expression": "\\(u+v=3\\)",
          "tag": "正一次"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "待求部分",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)",
          "tag": "负一次｜常数 −1 不动"
        },
        "organization": {
          "homogenizationHint": {
            "originalLabel": "待求部分",
            "original": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)",
            "originalDegree": "−1",
            "conditionLabel": "乘入定值",
            "condition": "\\(u+v=3\\)",
            "conditionDegree": "+1",
            "resultDegree": "0",
            "resultLabel": "0 次式",
            "result": "\\(2+\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
            "balance": "\\((-1)+(+1)=0\\)",
            "ariaLabel": "保留目标中的常数负 1，只把负一次倒数和与正一次条件相乘，配成零次齐次式"
          }
        },
        "reading": "次数配成 0",
        "route": "配齐次式"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "常数 \\(-1\\) 不影响最小值的位置，只需研究 \\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "倒数和是负一次式，条件左边 \\(u+v\\) 是正一次式"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "两者相乘的总次数为 \\(0\\)，可用新条件配成零次齐次式"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "路线判断",
          "保留常数 −1｜对倒数和配齐次式"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "配齐次式",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "showFocus": false,
        "condition": {
          "label": "乘入的定值式",
          "expression": "\\(u+v=3\\)",
          "tag": "正一次"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "待求部分",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)",
          "tag": "负一次"
        },
        "organization": {
          "label": "配齐次式：乘入条件并展开",
          "steps": [
            "\\(3(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})=(u+v)(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})\\)",
            "\\(3(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})=2+\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)"
          ],
          "note": "只对倒数和配齐次；原目标中的常数 −1 不动"
        },
        "pattern": {
          "first": {
            "value": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}\\)",
            "shape": "square"
          },
          "second": {
            "value": "\\(\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
            "shape": "circle"
          },
          "condition": {
            "operator": "·",
            "tag": "定积 1"
          },
          "target": {
            "operator": "+",
            "tag": "求最小值"
          },
          "ariaLabel": "配齐次后，正项 u 比 v 与 v 比 u 的积固定为 1，求和的最小值"
        },
        "reading": "定积求和",
        "route": "应用基本不等式"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(u+v=3\\)，乘入条件左边后得到倒数和的 \\(3\\) 倍"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(3(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})=(u+v)(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v})=2+\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}>0，\\frac{v}{u}>0\\)，且 \\(\\frac{u}{v}\\cdot\\frac{v}{u}=1\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "配齐后得到「定积求和」结构，原目标中的常数 \\(-1\\) 仍保留"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "配齐结果",
          "3 倍倒数和＝2＋两个定积正项"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "应用基本不等式",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-mapping",
        "methodTag": "配齐次式｜定积求和",
        "templateLabel": "代入基本不等式",
        "template": "\\(u+v\\ge2\\sqrt{uv}\\)",
        "formulaStyle": "sum-geometric",
        "showPositiveStep": true,
        "mappings": [
          {
            "slot": "第一个正项",
            "shape": "square",
            "value": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}\\)",
            "condition": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}>0\\)"
          },
          {
            "slot": "第二个正项",
            "shape": "circle",
            "value": "\\(\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
            "condition": "\\(\\frac{v}{u}>0\\)"
          }
        ],
        "mappedSum": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
        "mappedProduct": "\\(1\\)",
        "mapped": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\ge2\\sqrt1\\)",
        "stageLabel": "代入定积",
        "fixedSourceTarget": "product",
        "fixedSourceLabel": "已知",
        "fixedCondition": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}\\cdot\\frac{v}{u}=1\\)",
        "replacementText": "应用基本不等式",
        "replaced": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\ge2\\)",
        "simplifyLabel": "代回配齐式与原目标",
        "substituted": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\ge\\frac{4}{3}\\Rightarrow-1+\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\ge\\frac{1}{3}\\)",
        "conclusionLabel": "得到原目标下界",
        "conclusion": "\\(\\frac{a^2}{a+1}+\\frac{b^2}{b+1}\\ge\\frac{1}{3}\\)"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}>0，\\frac{v}{u}>0\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}+\\frac{v}{u}\\ge2\\sqrt{\\frac{u}{v}\\cdot\\frac{v}{u}}=2\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\ge\\frac{4}{3}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "原目标为 \\(-1+\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{v}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "原目标不小于 \\(-1+\\frac{4}{3}=\\frac{1}{3}\\)"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "下界",
          "1/3"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "验证取等并还原",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-equality-check",
        "templateLabel": "基本不等式取等",
        "first": {
          "value": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}\\)",
          "shape": "square"
        },
        "second": {
          "value": "\\(\\frac{v}{u}\\)",
          "shape": "circle"
        },
        "conditionLabel": "结合新条件并还原",
        "condition": "\\(u+v=3，a=u-1，b=v-1\\)",
        "solved": "\\(u=v=\\frac{3}{2}\\Rightarrow a=b=\\frac{1}{2}\\)",
        "verificationLabel": "代回原目标",
        "verification": "\\(\\frac{a^2}{a+1}+\\frac{b^2}{b+1}=\\frac{1}{3}\\)",
        "conclusion": "原式的最小值为 \\(\\frac{1}{3}\\)"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "基本不等式取等 ⇔ 两个正项相等"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{u}{v}=\\frac{v}{u}\\Rightarrow u=v\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(u+v=3\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(u=v=\\frac{3}{2}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "由 \\(a=u-1，b=v-1\\)，得 \\(a=b=\\frac{1}{2}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "代回原式得 \\(\\frac{1}{3}\\)，故最小值可以取得"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "最小值",
          "1/3"
        ],
        [
          "取等",
          "a=b=1/2"
        ]
      ]
    }
